以下代码 `delete base_ptr` 时只调用 `~Base`，派生类申请的资源泄漏。请修复（最小改动）：

```cpp
struct Base { ~Base() { /* 释放基类资源 */ } };
struct Derived : Base {
  int* buf = new int[64];
  ~Derived() { delete[] buf; }
};
int main() { Base* p = new Derived; delete p; }
```

